            community. For example the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+differential+geometry"} synthetic differential geometry
            of Lawvere and Kock (more in next paragraph) and the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nonstandard+analysis"} nonstandard analysis
            of Robinson, and its variant,
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internal+set"} internal set
            theory of Nelson are some of the principal examples. See also
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fermat+theory"} Fermat theory
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+numbers+object"} natural numbers object
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimal+number"} infinitesimal number
            etc. Many statements are about the versions without the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/axiom+of+choice"} axiom of choice
            and so on; we like to state clean and minimal conditions when possible.
          %h3#on_smoothness_and_generalized_lie_theory On smoothness and generalized Lie theory
          %p
