            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+form"} differential form
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+space"} tangent space
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/jet+bundles"} jet bundles
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimal+object"} infinitesimal object
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/microlinear+space"} microlinear space
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+smooth+algebra"} generalized smooth algebra
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+category"} tangent category
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cotangent+complex"} cotangent complex
            as defining ingredients of various notions of smoothness and smooth spaces. Main framework to systematize in geometry similar notion studied in
            = succeed "lab" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi n
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+differential+geometry"} synthetic differential geometry
            but many other examples are also represented. Let us mention
            = succeed "," do
